WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.240
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.970
Don't make your stomach anomalous!

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:12.610
SCP-184 is capable of expanding the space
within any structure it is inside, but that

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.410
doesn't mean it's a good idea to try and swallow
it to expand your stomach!

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:23.269
Dr. Bright is not permitted to ingest SCP-184
in order to win a pie-eating contest, a hotdog-eating

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:26.779
contest, or any other kind of eating or drinking
contest.

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:31.320
Not only is it potentially dangerous, it's
also cheating!

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.200
Other people work hard to win pie-eating contests.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.510
Using a shortcut to beat them is just plain
wrong.

